# Push = GitHub + Vercel

When the user asks to **push** (or similar: ship, deploy, upload):

1. Commit any pending relevant changes if needed (with a clear message)
2. `git push` to GitHub `origin`
3. Deploy production with `npx vercel --prod --yes` (do not wait only on GitHub auto-deploy)

Always report both the GitHub commit and the live Vercel URL when done.
